#
#	OpenTPW winter extension: the gluhwein stall (modelled on the keys of the original drinks shops: ShopType 4 with the Ice ingredient, relabelled "Spices" for this object).
#	A warm spiced drink with no drunk effects: Theme Park World has no intoxication state and none is added ([EXT:winter-gluehwein-no-drunk]).
#	Every number marked "OpenTPW's own value" is a choice of this extension (docs/WINTER.md). Nothing is read from Theme Park World's or Theme Park Inc's data.
#
Info.Id			64011		placeholder: objects.json replaces it with the object's own id
Info.Name		"Gluehwein Stall"
Info.IsChoosable	1
Info.HasQueue		0		a shop: guests walk to it and buy, no queue
Info.WhichUIType	1		a shop (the build menu's Shops tab)

# A 2 x 2 market hut. The entrance '2' (where the customer stands, facing the counter) is the lower left cell.
Info.Shape
---
**
2*
---

# The construction fence for 2 x 2 cells: the four corner pieces
Info.Hoarding
---
F7
LJ
---

# 4 = a drinks shop, with the special ingredient 3 (Ice's mechanics: the slider gives thirst back); the stall uses the drinks code path, the drinks challenge and the drinks price statistics
UsageInfo.ShopType			4
UsageInfo.SpecialIngredient		3
UsageInfo.InitCostOfGoods		15		OpenTPW's own value (the original drinks shops: 20)
UsageInfo.InitPricePerUse		30		the drinks shops' price (decision of October 18, 2026)
UsageInfo.EntryCellStandPosX	0.5
UsageInfo.EntryCellStandPosY	0.5
UsageInfo.ExitCellAppearPosX	0.5
UsageInfo.ExitCellAppearPosY	0.5
UsageInfo.RideHandlesSprite	1		the shop's script hides the customer while serving
UsageInfo.MinCapacity		0		always zero for shops
UsageInfo.MaxCapacity		0		always zero for shops

UsageInfo.ISIndoors			0

UsageInfo.ThirstEffect		30		OpenTPW's own value (the original drinks shops: 40)
UsageInfo.HungerEffect		5		OpenTPW's own value
UsageInfo.VomitEffect		5		half a drinks shop's 10: no drunk effects, and a warm drink adds half a drinks shop's vomit
UsageInfo.HappinessEffect		15		OpenTPW's own value
UsageInfo.LitterEffect		40		OpenTPW's own value (mugs)

UsageInfo.AppearanceEffect		0		the stall gives no item; with opentpw.winter-cold on it warms the guest instead (WinterInfo.WarmEffectDays)

# The ingredient slider's label for this object only ([EXT:winter-spice-label]); the mechanics stay Ice's
WinterInfo.IngredientLabel		"Spices"
WinterInfo.WarmEffectDays		1		a glühwein warms the guest for one game day (opentpw.winter-cold, [EXT:winter-gluehwein])

# Demand, percent of the attraction score (read by the winter extension for its own objects only). No gate: thirst drives it like any drink.
# The weather keys are Theme Park Inc's names (its warm food is 200, its cold drinks 50), the season keys are this extension's own ([EXT:winter-season-terms]).
WeatherModifier.SnowPercentage		250		OpenTPW's own value
WeatherModifier.RainPercentage		130		OpenTPW's own value
WeatherModifier.StormPercentage		130		OpenTPW's own value
SeasonModifier.WinterPercentage	150
SeasonModifier.SpringPercentage	60
SeasonModifier.SummerPercentage	20
SeasonModifier.AutumnPercentage	60

Research.Group		0		available from the start, no research
Info.PreviewAnimNum		0

Upgrades[0].InitCapacity		1		OpenTPW's own value (the original drinks shops: 1)
Upgrades[0].CostOfUpgrade		750		OpenTPW's own value
Upgrades[0].CostOfResearch		0		An object without research cost starts researched
Upgrades[0].RunningCost		30		OpenTPW's own value (a Theme Park Inc key; the original does not read it)
